# YouTube Analytics and Growth Engine

Lux provides transport-neutral helpers for YouTube channel analytics, growth
projection, competitor benchmarking, retention summaries, ROI tracking, channel
audits, and automated reporting.

## Metric Snapshots

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.YouTube.GrowthEngine

snapshot = %{
  captured_at: "2026-05-13",
  views: 1_000,
  watch_time_hours: 80,
  subscribers: 120,
  revenue: 25.0,
  impressions: 5_000,
  clicks: 250,
  likes: 20,
  comments: 10
}

GrowthEngine.snapshot(snapshot)
```

## Growth Projection

```elixir
GrowthEngine.growth_projection([
  %{captured_at: "2026-05-12", views: 1_000, subscribers: 100, revenue: 20.0},
  %{captured_at: "2026-05-13", views: 1_300, subscribers: 130, revenue: 26.0}
])
```

## Competitor Benchmarking

```elixir
GrowthEngine.competitor_benchmark(snapshot, [
  %{views: 800, clicks: 80, impressions: 2_000},
  %{views: 1_200, clicks: 120, impressions: 3_000}
])
```

## Retention and ROI

```elixir
GrowthEngine.retention_summary([
  %{second: 0, retained_ratio: 1.0},
  %{second: 60, retained_ratio: 0.48}
])

GrowthEngine.roi_summary(%{
  revenue: 500,
  production_cost: 200,
  promotion_cost: 50
})
```

## Channel Audit

```elixir
GrowthEngine.audit(snapshot)
```

## Automated Report

```elixir
GrowthEngine.report(%{
  channel_id: "channel-1",
  snapshots: [snapshot],
  competitors: [%{views: 900, clicks: 90, impressions: 2_000}],
  retention_points: [%{second: 0, retained_ratio: 1.0}],
  roi: %{revenue: 100, production_cost: 40, promotion_cost: 10}
})
```

Use the report output as input to scheduled beams, dashboards, or notification
workflows.
